.agents
skills-lock.json

# Local SEO working files, kept in the repo root but never committed.
# The Screaming Frog control sheet and the Search Console baselines are the
# owner's working documents, not project artefacts — they are opened in Excel
# (which leaves ~$ lock files) and are exported afresh each time. What matters
# from them is written into spec/features/ instead.
mrgoma-control-implementacion-seo.xlsx
~$*.xlsx
gsc-baseline-*.zip
gsc-baseline-*.csv
